cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its result files, please cite this repository and the associated article when available."
title: "Cross-Feature Residual Interpolation (CFRI) for contiguous gaps in financial time series: code, protocols, and results"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kotan"
    given-names: "Kurban"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6660-0565"
    affiliation: "Manisa Celal Bayar University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kurbankotan/cfri-financial-time-series-imputation"
url: "https://github.com/kurbankotan/cfri-financial-time-series-imputation"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - missing data imputation
  - financial time series
  - contiguous missing blocks
  - cross-feature residual interpolation
  - OHLC consistency
  - external validation
abstract: >-
  Public source, protocols, notebooks, derived results, and verification code
  for CFRI imputation of missing financial time-series blocks. The repository
  also preserves the original ITRI development and external-validation studies,
  a prespecified CFRI fold D test, a locally frozen new-asset holdout, and an
  exploratory candle-coordinate replay. Raw vendor market tables are excluded.
